          li.col-sm-6.col-lg-4
            .box-outline
              .list-index-counter
              h5 Check your rate in 2 minutes
              p.text-spacing-50 Just answer a few quick questions about your education and employment.
          li.col-sm-6.col-lg-4
            .box-outline
              .list-index-counter
              h5 Get your money the next day
              p.text-spacing-50 After your application is approved, you'll have a chance to review your loan.
          li.col-sm-6.col-lg-4
            .box-outline
              .list-index-counter
              h5 Repay: set it and forget it
              p.text-spacing-50 It's easy to set up automated monthly payments without any penalties.

